Asset origins for driftline. Every model file under assets/ comes from one of
the packs below. Generated files (assets/pieces/, assets/collision/) are derived from these packs.

| Path                 | Pack                     | Source                                | License |
|----------------------|--------------------------|---------------------------------------|---------|
| assets/racing-kit/   | Kenney Racing Kit (2.0)  | https://kenney.nl/assets/racing-kit   | CC0 1.0 |
| assets/car-kit/      | Kenney Car Kit           | https://kenney.nl/assets/car-kit      | CC0 1.0 |
| assets/nature-kit/   | Kenney Nature Kit (2.1)  | https://kenney.nl/assets/nature-kit   | CC0 1.0 |
| assets/sky/          | Poly Haven HDRI kloofendal_48d_partly_cloudy_puresky (1K) | https://polyhaven.com/a/kloofendal_48d_partly_cloudy_puresky | CC0 1.0 |
| assets/textures/     | Poly Haven aerial_grass_rock diffuse (1K) | https://polyhaven.com/a/aerial_grass_rock | CC0 1.0 |
| public/favicon.svg   | Vite logo from the create-vite template | https://github.com/vitejs/vite/tree/main/packages/create-vite | MIT |
| assets/pieces/       | Derived from assets/racing-kit/ by scripts/build-pieces.mjs; banked.glb is generated by that script | this repo | CC0 1.0 |
| assets/collision/    | Generated by scripts/build-pieces.mjs from assets/track/pieces.json | this repo | CC0 1.0 |

Original license files: assets/LICENSES/. CC0 1.0:
http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Only CC0 packs are allowed in this directory; no paid-license or third-party game assets.
